==Strategy==
[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is incredibly helpful here, being able to deal massive damage to the Shy Boys, and can also knock back the Mr. Angel. As this stage is a spam of early units, you're gonna need tanky meatshields as well, and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is rather helpful, but you can also just send in cheap ones like [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]]. You absolutely want to start sending out these meatshields as soon as possible, since the boss wave is almost certainly going to push your units beyond your base if you can't gain ground early on. <!--rewrite-->

